  (text "KIRO Wiring V2  |  Wheel_Drive"
    (at 20.32 20.32 0)
    (effects (font (size 3 3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e75b6aa4-9b83-4bba-b35e-6096bcdd27de")
  )
  (text "4 x Feetech/Waveshare ST3215-C018 smart serial servos on one CH343 bus adapter (no generic motor driver)"
    (at 20.32 25.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e7af2c60-5fb9-4a81-875c-efaabb88173d")
  )
  (text "Chain 1 (BUS1): adapter -> FR ID7 -> RR ID9.  Chain 2 (BUS2): adapter -> FL ID8 -> RL ID10.  Max two servos per Molex 5264 contact (~3 A)."
    (at 20.32 152.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "748b8f73-1a25-4639-bb10-54ebfffb5617")
  )
  (text "Supply: REGULATED_12V (ST3215 6-12.6 V; V1 Max_Voltage_Limit 14.0 V). Adapter powered via screw terminal, not its DC jack."
    (at 20.32 157.48 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "0e04f06f-ed19-4801-a815-e1bb548aa802")
  )
  (text "Current: idle ~1.2 A total, design 6 A, all four stalled 10.8 A (2.7 A each). Feed 14 AWG to screw terminal; 20 AWG servo leads."
    (at 20.32 162.56 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "8adb1a2a-66aa-428c-8947-ee60cf302452")
  )
  (text "Servo cable: 3-pin Molex 5264 (V+, GND, DATA). Physical pin order: verify against Waveshare ST3215 wiki before crimping (TBD)."
    (at 20.32 167.64 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "7cbdc985-753d-42d7-b435-b6e60c960558")
  )
  (text "Data: half-duplex TTL 1 Mbps. USB_WHEEL via powered hub. Servo GND returns to the adapter, never through the USB cable shield."
    (at 20.32 172.72 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "0d261da6-9924-4b59-a144-31e27326eb6c")
  )
  (text "E-stop: K1 removes REGULATED_12V -> servos unpowered, no holding torque, robot coasts. Speed feedback over bus = ROBOT_MOVING."
    (at 20.32 177.8 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "4b99a316-efcd-4432-9145-3fa53f6a1cc2")
  )
